sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / KFP Component
    participant Exp as AI4RAGExperiment
    participant SS as SearchSpace
    participant HPO as HPO Engine<br/>(GAM / Random)
    participant MPS as Model Pre-Selection
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>HTTPS / TLS
    participant Chunker as Chunker<br/>(Docling / LangChain)
    participant VS as Vector Store<br/>(OGX / ChromaDB)
    participant RAG as SimpleRAG Template
    participant Eval as Evaluator<br/>(Unitxt / LLMaJ)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EH as EventHandler<br/>(Local / KFP)

    Note over User,EH: Flow 1: RAG Optimization Experiment

    User->>Exp: documents + benchmark Q&A pairs
    Exp->>SS: define search space<br/>(models, chunk sizes, retrievers)
    SS->>OGX: discover available models<br/>HTTPS / API Key
    OGX-->>SS: model list

    Note over Exp,OGX: Phase 1: Model Pre-Selection
    Exp->>MPS: pre-select foundation & embedding models
    MPS->>OGX: chat.completions.create<br/>HTTPS / API Key
    OGX-->>MPS: responses
    MPS->>Eval: evaluate on subset
    Eval-->>MPS: scores
    MPS-->>Exp: top-N models

    Note over Exp,EH: Phase 2: Optimization Loop (N iterations)
    loop Each HPO Iteration
        Exp->>HPO: request next parameter set
        HPO-->>Exp: {chunk_size, overlap, model,<br/>embedding, search_mode, top_k, ...}

        Exp->>Chunker: chunk documents
        Chunker-->>Exp: AI4RAGChunks<br/>(SHA-256 IDs)

        Exp->>OGX: embeddings.create<br/>HTTPS / API Key
        OGX-->>Exp: embedding vectors

        Exp->>VS: vector_io.insert<br/>HTTPS / API Key
        VS-->>Exp: collection created

        loop Each benchmark question (parallel, 10 threads)
            Exp->>VS: vector_io.query<br/>HTTPS / API Key
            VS-->>Exp: retrieved contexts

            Exp->>RAG: generate answer with context
            RAG->>OGX: chat.completions.create<br/>HTTPS / API Key
            OGX-->>RAG: generated answer
            RAG-->>Exp: answer + context
        end

        Exp->>Eval: evaluate answers vs ground truth
        Note over Eval: unitxt metrics:<br/>answer_correctness,<br/>faithfulness,<br/>context_correctness
        Eval-->>Exp: metric scores + CI

        Exp->>Eval: LLM-as-a-Judge scoring
        Eval->>OGX: structured JSON output<br/>HTTPS / API Key
        OGX-->>Eval: judge scores (1-5 → [0,1])
        Eval-->>Exp: judge scores

        Exp->>EH: on_pattern_creation<br/>(PatternPayload)
        Exp->>HPO: update model with scores
    end

    Exp->>EH: on_experiment_end<br/>(best pattern + all results)
    EH-->>User: optimization results

    Note over User,S3: Flow 2: S3 Document Persistence
    Exp->>S3: PUT documents & assets<br/>HTTPS / AWS IAM
    S3-->>Exp: confirmation
